    "headline": "Triumph prices the 2027 Tiger 1200 at ₹20.99 lakh, on sale in India from March 2027",
    "text": "Triumph has revealed India pricing for the GT Pro and Rally Explorer, a couple of days after the global unveiling. Both use an updated 1,160cc liquid-cooled triple that makes 158hp, 8hp more than before, and 130Nm. Semi-active Showa suspension with automatic self-levelling and radar-based rider aids are new. The front wheel is now 19 inches on both, so the 21-inch option is gone.",
    "why": "The flagship adventure tourer now has a price and a date, so buyers can plan ahead of the March 2027 arrival.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "name": "Autocar India",
        "url": "https://www.autocarindia.com/bike-news/2027-triumph-tiger-1200-launched-at-rs-2099-lakh-441157"
